                <head>Agreements between the United States and the United Kingdom</head>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND THE UNITED KINGDOM
                    RESPECTING AIR TRANSPORT SERVICES CONCERNING GANDER AIRPORT, NEWFOUNDLAND</p>
                <p>[For text of this Agreement, effected by exchange of notes signed at London, May
                    21 and 23, 1947, see Department of State Treaties and Other International Acts
                    Series (TIAS) No. 1641, or 61 Stat. (pt. 3)
                    3092.]</p>
